    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "秀さんは、どのキャラを使っているんですか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_047_01_b:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_047_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "一番はコレ。俺と年が近い男キャラなんだけど。\n性格がめちゃくちゃ攻撃的で面白いんだよな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "047shu"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "047shu",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 9
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_047_01_b:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_047_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "けど、自分のポリシーがちゃんとあってさ。\n筋を通す一面もあるカッコいいヤツなんだぜ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "047shu"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "047shu",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 10
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_047_01_b:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_047_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それに全キャラ中トップクラスでパワー値が高い。\nバフかければゴリ押しで勝てるから効率いいんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "047shu"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "047shu",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 11
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_047_01_b:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_2_047_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "戦略を立てて戦うのも好きだけど、\n時間がない時は特にこのキャラを使ってるかな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "047shu"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "047shu",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 12
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_2_047_01_b:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
